# Read by `vite build` (production mode). Copy to `.env.production`.
#
# The API's HTTPS address — the `ApiUrl` output of the SAM stack:
#   just deploy-outputs-dev     (or deploy-outputs-prod)
#
# Whatever origin the built app is served from must also be listed in the
# backend's API_CORS_ORIGINS, or every call fails the preflight.
#
# Everything here ships inside the bundle. Never put a secret in this file.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://example.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws
